{{/*
  fragments/table/row — the HTMX entry point for a single row, rendered with a
  dto.TableRow.

  Create answers with OOB "afterbegin:#<plural>-tbody" so the new row appears at
  the top of the listing; update answers with OOB "true" so the existing row is
  replaced in place. Because it is the generic row template, a generated module
  ships no row markup of its own.
*/}}
{{ template "table/row" . }}
